{"id":4420,"date":"2025-02-03T12:08:21","date_gmt":"2025-02-03T02:38:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=4420"},"modified":"2025-10-26T15:44:12","modified_gmt":"2025-10-26T06:14:12","slug":"watch-video-schema-generator","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/watch-video-schema-generator\/","title":{"rendered":"Watch video schema generator"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4420\" class=\"elementor elementor-4420\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e4f2aa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2e4f2aa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2938e0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"2938e0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <style>\n\n\n      body {\n        background-color: #fef7f1 !important;\n  \n         font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto,\n          Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif !important;\n      }\n\n      .container {\n        max-width: 1200px !important;\n        margin: 0 auto !important;\n        line-height: 24px\n      }\n\n      .header1 {\n        text-align: center !important;\n     margin-bottom: 3rem !important;\n    margin-top: 3rem;\n      }\n\n      .logo {\n        height: 60px !important;\n        margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .title {\n        font-size: 2.5rem !important;\n        color: #333 !important;\n        margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .subtitle {\n        color: #666 !important;\n        font-size: 1.1rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .grid {\n        display: grid !important;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(500px, 1fr)) !important;\n        gap: 2rem !important;\n        margin-top: 2rem !important;\n        margin-bottom: 4rem\n      }\n\n      .card {\n        background: white !important;\n        border-radius: 10px !important;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) !important;\n        padding: 2rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .card-header {\n        display: flex !important;\n        align-items: center !important;\n        margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .card-title {\n        font-size: 1.25rem !important;\n        font-weight: 600 !important;\n        color: #333 !important;\n        margin-left: 0.5rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .form-group {\n        margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;\n      }\n\n      label {\n        display: block !important;\n        margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;\n        color: #555 !important;\n        font-weight: 500 !important;\n      }\n\n      input {\n        width: 100% !important;\n        padding: 0.75rem !important;\n        border: 1px solid #ddd !important;\n        border-radius: 6px !important;\n        font-size: 1rem !important;\n        transition: border-color 0.2s !important;\n      }\n\n      input:focus {\n        outline: none !important;\n        border-color: #ff6b35 !important;\n      }\n\n      .json-output {\n        background: #1a1a1a !important;\n        border-radius: 8px !important;\n        padding: 1.5rem !important;\n        margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n        overflow-x: auto !important;\n      }\n\n      pre {\n        color: #fff !important;\n        font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Courier New', monospace !important;\n        font-size: 0.9rem !important;\n        white-space: pre-wrap !important;\n        word-wrap: break-word !important;\n      }\n\n      .script-tag {\n        color: #e06c75 !important;\n      }\n\n      .button {\n        width: 100% !important;\n        padding: 0.75rem !important;\n        border: none !important;\n        border-radius: 6px !important;\n        font-size: 1rem !important;\n        font-weight: 500 !important;\n        cursor: pointer !important;\n        display: flex !important;\n        align-items: center !important;\n        justify-content: center !important;\n        transition: background-color 0.2s !important;\n      }\n\n      .button-primary {\n       color: black !important;\n\n    background: var(--Gradient-Yellow-Orange, linear-gradient(108deg, #ffdd85 -5.9%, #ffdd85 21.86%, #f9ac6e 52.08%, #fa8273 81.69%, #f9ac6e 112.53%));\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n      }\n\n      .button-primary:hover {\n        background-color: #ff5a1f !important;\n      }\n\n      .button-outline {\n        background-color: white !important;\n        color: #666 !important;\n        border: 1px solid #ddd !important;\n      }\n\n      .button-outline:hover {\n        background-color: #f5f5f5 !important;\n      }\n\n      .icon {\n        margin-right: 0.5rem !important;\n      }\n\n      .success-alert {\n        background-color: #ecfdf5 !important;\n        border: 1px solid #10b981 !important;\n        color: #047857 !important;\n        padding: 1rem !important;\n        border-radius: 6px !important;\n        margin-top: 1rem !important;\n        text-align: center !important;\n      }\n\n      @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n        .grid {\n          grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\n        }\n      }\n      .run{\n          margin: 10px\n          \n      }\n    <\/style>\n  <\/head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <header class=\"header1\">\n        <h1 class=\"title\">Watch video schema generator<\/h1>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">\n         Create accurate Video schema Markup to boost your search engine visibility.\n        <\/p>\n      <\/header>\n\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-header\">\n            <svg\n              class=\"icon\"\n              width=\"24\"\n              height=\"24\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M16 18l6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\" \/>\n            <\/svg>\n            <h2 class=\"card-title\">Input Details<\/h2>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <form id=\"schemaForm\">\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"title\">Video Title<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"title\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter video title\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"description\">Video Description<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"description\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter video description\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"thumbnailUrl\">Thumbnail URL<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"url\"\n                id=\"thumbnailUrl\"\n                placeholder=\"https:\/\/example.com\/thumbnail.jpg\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n                   <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"embedUrl\">YouTube Embed URL<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"url\"\n                id=\"embedUrl\"\n                placeholder=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/video-id\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n            \n                 <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"thumbnailUrl\">Publisher Name<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"PublisherName\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter your Publisher Name Example - FeedOps\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"thumbnailUrl\">Logo Url<\/label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                id=\"LogoUrl\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter your Publisher Logo Url\"\n                required\n              \/>\n            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"uploadDate\">Upload Date<\/label>\n              <input type=\"date\" id=\"uploadDate\" required \/>\n            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label for=\"duration\">Duration (e.g., 3.34 for 3m34s)<\/label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"duration\" placeholder=\"3.34\" required \/>\n            <\/div>\n\n     \n\n            <button type=\"reset\" class=\"button button-outline\">\n              <svg\n                class=\"icon\"\n                width=\"16\"\n                height=\"16\"\n                viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n                fill=\"none\"\n                stroke=\"currentColor\"\n                stroke-width=\"2\"\n              >\n                <path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8\" \/>\n                <path d=\"M21 3v5h-5\" \/>\n              <\/svg>\n              Reset Form\n            <\/button>\n          <\/form>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"card-header\">\n            <svg\n              class=\"icon\"\n              width=\"24\"\n              height=\"24\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M16 18l6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\" \/>\n            <\/svg>\n            <h2 class=\"card-title\">Generated JSON-LD<\/h2>\n                   <button type=\"reset\" style=\"display: flex\n;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 33px;\" class=\"button-outline\">\n   <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/search.google.com\/test\/rich-results\" >  Test<\/a>\n            \n            <\/button>\n                            <button type=\"reset\" style=\"display: flex\n;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 113px;\" class=\"button-outline\">\n   <a  target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/developers.google.com\/search\/docs\/appearance\/structured-data\" >  Validate<\/a>\n            \n            <\/button>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <div class=\"json-output\">\n            <pre\n              id=\"jsonOutput\"\n            ><span class=\"script-tag\">&lt;script type=\"application\/ld+json\"&gt;<\/span>\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"uploadDate\": \"\",\n  \"duration\": \"\",\n  \"embedUrl\": \"\",\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n<span class=\"script-tag\">\n  \/\/ Generated by feedOps.com \n&lt;\/script&gt;<\/span><\/pre>\n          <\/div>\n\n          <button id=\"copyButton\" class=\"button button-primary\">\n            <svg\n              class=\"icon\"\n              width=\"16\"\n              height=\"16\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            >\n              <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" \/>\n              <path\n                d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"\n              \/>\n            <\/svg>\n            Copy JSON-LD\n          <\/button>\n          \n     \n          \n\n          <div id=\"successAlert\" class=\"success-alert\" style=\"display: none\">\n            JSON-LD copied to clipboard!\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <script>\n      const form = document.getElementById('schemaForm');\n      const inputs = form.querySelectorAll('input');\n      const jsonOutput = document.getElementById('jsonOutput');\n      const copyButton = document.getElementById('copyButton');\n      const successAlert = document.getElementById('successAlert');\n\n      function convertDurationToISO8601(duration) {\n        const [minutes, seconds] = duration.toString().split('.');\n        const formattedSeconds = seconds ? seconds.padEnd(2, '0') : '00';\n        return `PT${minutes}M${formattedSeconds}S`;\n      }\n\nfunction formatDateToISO(dateString) {\n  if (!dateString) return ''; \n  return new Date(dateString).toISOString(); \n}\n\n      function updateJSON() {\n        const jsonData = {\n          '@context': 'https:\/\/schema.org',\n          '@type': 'VideoObject',\n          'name': document.getElementById('title').value,\n          'description': document.getElementById('description').value,\n          'thumbnailUrl': document.getElementById('thumbnailUrl').value,\n          'uploadDate': formatDateToISO(document.getElementById('uploadDate').value),\n          'duration': convertDurationToISO8601(\n            document.getElementById('duration').value\n          ),\n          'embedUrl': document.getElementById('embedUrl').value,\n          'publisher': {\n            '@type': 'Organization',\n            'name': document.getElementById('PublisherName').value,\n            'logo': {\n              '@type': 'ImageObject',\n              'url':document.getElementById('LogoUrl').value,\n            },\n          },\n        };\n\n        \/\/ Format with script tags\n        jsonOutput.innerHTML = `<span class=\"script-tag\">&lt;script type=\"application\/ld+json\"&gt;<\/span>\n${JSON.stringify(jsonData, null, 2)}\n<span class=\"script-tag\">\n  \/\/ Generated by feedOps.com \n&lt;\/script&gt;<\/span>`;\n      }\n\n      inputs.forEach((input) => {\n        input.addEventListener('input', updateJSON);\n      });\n\n      copyButton.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        \/\/ Get the text content including script tags\n        const textToCopy = jsonOutput.textContent;\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(textToCopy);\n        successAlert.style.display = 'block';\n        setTimeout(() => {\n          successAlert.style.display = 'none';\n        }, 2000);\n      });\n\n      form.addEventListener('reset', () => {\n        setTimeout(updateJSON, 0);\n      });\n    <\/script>\n  <\/body>\n<\/html>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8971c40 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8971c40\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a82a920 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a82a920\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f92ac3b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f92ac3b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ac208ce0-3a6d-45d2-a297-8b239cf03c92\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\"><h3><strong>Boost Video Visibility with Google-Approved Structured Data<\/strong><\/h3><p>Video content is a powerful tool for engagement and traffic growth, but to maximize its impact, search engines must correctly index and understand your videos. According to Google\u2019s official guidelines on Video structured data <a href=\"https:\/\/developers.google.com\/search\/docs\/appearance\/structured-data\/video\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/developers.google.com\/search\/docs\/appearance\/structured-data\/video<\/a>, adding structured data improves video visibility in search results, leading to higher rankings and better click-through rates. Our <strong>Video Schema Generator<\/strong> helps you implement this best practice effortlessly.<\/p><h3><strong>Easy Video Schema Markup Creation<\/strong><\/h3><p>Enhance your video SEO with our <strong>Video Schema Generator<\/strong>. Whether you&#8217;re a content creator, SEO professional, or website owner, this tool streamlines structured data implementation. Simply enter key details like the video title, description, upload date, and thumbnail URL, and our tool will generate <strong>Google-compliant<\/strong> schema markup that you can add directly to your website.<\/p><h3><strong>Increase Rankings &amp; Get Rich Results<\/strong><\/h3><p>Using <strong>VideoObject structured data<\/strong> (as outlined in Google\u2019s developer documentation: <a href=\"https:\/\/developers.google.com\/search\/docs\/appearance\/structured-data\/video#videoobjec\">https:\/\/developers.google.com\/search\/docs\/appearance\/structured-data\/video#videoobjec<\/a>t helps search engines understand your content better. This increases the likelihood of your videos appearing as <strong>rich results<\/strong>, driving more organic traffic and engagement.<\/p><p>Optimize your videos today with our <strong>Video Schema Generator<\/strong> and ensure they meet Google\u2019s structured data requirements for maximum search visibility.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Watch video schema generator Create accurate Video schema Markup to boost your search engine visibility. Input Details Video Title Video Description Thumbnail URL YouTube Embed URL Publisher Name Logo Url Upload Date Duration (e.g., 3.34 for 3m34s) Reset Form Generated JSON-LD Test Validate &lt;script type=&#8221;application\/ld+json&#8221;&gt; { &#8220;@context&#8221;: &#8220;https:\/\/schema.org&#8221;, &#8220;@type&#8221;: &#8220;VideoObject&#8221;, &#8220;name&#8221;: &#8220;&#8221;, &#8220;description&#8221;: &#8220;Lorem ipsum [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4420","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Watch video schema generator - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Generate Google-compliant Video schema markup easily with FeedOps\u2019 Video Schema Generator to boost video SEO, rankings\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/watch-video-schema-generator\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Watch video schema generator\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Generate Google-complian